      "id": "2126501236979663262",
      "text": "Nembhard: 5 for 9 FGs Rest of IND starters: 6 for 33 Stunningly unproductive numbers. Without Haliburton or McConnell, the offense really drags. And it's an unusual off game for Siakam: 6pts on 1-for-12 shooting.",
