    },
    {
      "id": "2126497611129794896",
      "text": "Nembhard for 3. He's got two of the Pacers' three 3s. Sixers zone has given up two of them but it's taken away a lot of the paint touches and the Pacers' shooting isn't enough to make up the difference.",
