    {
      "id": "2126488266241118594",
      "text": "Ivica Zubac scores his first field goal to put the Pacers within one. On the other end, he picked up his 10th rebound. While going against Embiid, so that's big. Pacers haven't played well and they're 1/13 from outside, yet they're right there.",
