    },
    {
      "id": "2126482754301005847",
      "text": "Something to watch early: foul trouble on Philly. Called for nine fouls to the Pacers' two. Tyrese Maxey (scoreless) and Jabari Walker have two apiece. 9-0 Pacers run since Jalen Slawson checked in (and LeBron checked out).",
